        <li><a href="https://github.com/Ericwimsatt/manhunt" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="proj-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M10 2a5 5 0 0 0-5 5c0 3.5 5 11 5 11s5-7.5 5-11a5 5 0 0 0-5-5z" stroke="#1d3557" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><circle cx="10" cy="7" r="2" stroke="#1d3557" stroke-width="1.2"/></svg></span><span class="proj-text"><strong>manhunt</strong> &mdash; Companion app for a large scale game of manhunt in Golden Gate Park. <em>(React Native / TypeScript / Convex)</em></span></a></li>
